meta {
  name: Update profile
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

patch {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/profile
  body: json
}

body:json {
  {
    "first_name": "Chanda",
    "last_name": "Mwale",
    "email": "chanda@example.test",
    "phone": "0966111222",
    "province_id": 1,
    "city_id": 1,
    "street": "Cairo Road",
    "plot_number": "42"
  }
}

docs {
  Changing the phone number **clears the verification**, and the response says
  so with `phone_verification_required`. A number is the contact point for an
  order and the destination for a payout, so a changed number is an unproven
  one — send the person back through **01-auth / Verify phone**.
}
